  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "施工估價與規範",
    "sub_ename": "ESTIMATION AND SPECIFICATION OF CONSTRUCTION",
    "describe_ch": "公共工程之建造需有經費來執行，每項工程均需編列概算，進一步編列預算以作為發包之依據，工程發包後的施工需有規範來配合。本課程係介紹上述各項工程項目之估價編列方法(PCCES)、工程採購招標文件及契約寫作。",
    "describe_eh": "The construction of public works needs to be financed to carry out, each project is subject to budget estimates, further budgeting as the basis for the contract, the construction after the contract needs to be standardized to cooperate. This course introduces the public construction cost estimation system (PCCES), government procurement, tendering procedures for procurement and administration of contract performance for public constructions.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
